# 17. LARGE ENEMY GUARANTEE

Large Enemy tidak boleh gagal muncul karena RNG.

Flow:

```text
Floor = 30
     ↓
RNG Enemy Generation
     ↓
Check Large Enemy
     ↓
Large Enemy = FALSE
     ↓
System Override
     ↓
Generate Large Enemy
```

Jadi:

```text
RNG
+
Guarantee Rule
```

digunakan bersama.

