# 61. FINAL DESIGN PHILOSOPHY

Enemy di Aetheria bukan sekadar target untuk dibunuh.

Enemy merupakan bagian dari **World Simulation**.

Mereka memiliki:

```text
Identity
Faction
Behavior
AI
Group
Leader
Difficulty
Mutation
Relationship
Loot
World State
```

Jumlah mereka tidak selalu sama.

Komposisi mereka tidak selalu sama.

Perilaku mereka tidak selalu sama.

Bahkan kondisi sebuah Floor dapat membuat encounter berubah.

Namun terdapat satu aturan yang tidak berubah:

> **The Tower must be dangerous from Floor 1.**

Dan setiap sepuluh lantai:

> **Something bigger is waiting.**

```text
FLOOR 1
Hard

FLOOR 10
Hard + LARGE ENEMY

FLOOR 20
Very Hard + LARGE ENEMY

FLOOR 30
Very Hard + LARGE ENEMY

FLOOR 40
Extreme + LARGE ENEMY

FLOOR 50
Extreme + LARGE ENEMY

FLOOR 60
Nightmare + LARGE ENEMY

FLOOR 70
Nightmare + LARGE ENEMY

FLOOR 80
Catastrophic + LARGE ENEMY

FLOOR 90
Catastrophic + LARGE ENEMY

FLOOR 100
God Tier + LARGE ENEMY + NYTHAR
```

> **The number of enemies is decided by RNG.**
>
> **The composition is decided by RNG.**
>
> **The battlefield is controlled by AI.**
>
> **The world condition is controlled by Game State System.**
>
> **The loot is decided by RNG.**
>
> **The Fairy observes the battle.**
>
> **And the Master decides whether the party survives.**
